(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Evidence-based school interventions for obesity prevention often achieve incomplete) Tj
T*
(implementation in real-world settings due to organizational and resource barriers. This) Tj
T*
(protocol describes a hybrid type III cluster-randomized trial comparing two distinct) Tj
T*
(implementation strategy bundles for delivering a comprehensive school-based healthy) Tj
T*
(lifestyle program across multiple schools. Approximately 45 schools will be assigned to) Tj
T*
(receive either a basic implementation support bundle or an enhanced bundle incorporating) Tj
T*
(multiple implementation strategies including educational outreach, stakeholder engagement,) Tj
T*
(and clinical-school linkages. Outcomes assess the degree to which intervention components) Tj
T*
(are delivered with fidelity, measure parental responsiveness to health messaging, and) Tj
T*
(track organizational factors influencing successful adoption. We seek to identify the most) Tj
T*
(efficient and effective combination of implementation strategies to promote sustained) Tj
T*
(program delivery in school settings.) Tj
